Aggregator: `master_version="aggregation"`, `space="plan"`, `type_="main"`, `name="task_preamble"`, `version=None`.

| Sweep | Path | Outcome |
|---|---|---|
| root_0, folder_0, Pass 1A | `plan/main/_variables/task_preamble/aggregation/<None>.jinja2` | skip (no version) |
| root_0, folder_0, Pass 1B | `plan/main/_variables/task_preamble/aggregation/default.jinja2` | ✅ **FOUND** (post-migration) |

For `task_instructions` with `version="create_role"`:

| Sweep | Path | Outcome |
|---|---|---|
| root_0 (OS), folder_0, Pass 1A | `plan/main/_variables/task_instructions/aggregation/create_role.jinja2` | ✅ **FOUND** in OpenStartup root (post-migration) |

For breakdown inferencer (no master_version): `name="task_preamble"`, `version="create_role"`:

| Sweep | Path | Outcome |
|---|---|---|
| root_0, folder_0, Pass 2A | `task_breakdown/main/_variables/task_preamble/create_role.jinja2` | ✅ **FOUND** (no migration needed for this) |

