## §7 Phasing (Sequenced Execution)

| Phase | Duration | Deliverable | Validation Gate |
|---|---|---|---|
| **P1** | 2h | `FileSpaceManager` module (~600 lines) + unit tests (12 files) | All P1 tests green |
| **P2** | 2h | Migrate `FileBasedVariableManager` internals to delegate | All 10 existing tests still green |
| **P3** | 2h | Migrate `TemplateManager` internals to delegate | All 10 existing tests still green |
| **P4** | 1h | Add `template_master_version` to TemplateManager + InferencerBase | New AF unit test passes |
| **P5** | 30min | Migrate 6 Wave-1 files via `git mv` | Filesystem inventory matches §5.1 |
| **P6** | 30min | Update `template_defaults.py` SLOT_DEFAULTS: aggregator gets `template_master_version="aggregation"` | YAML render test passes |
| **P7** | 1h | RPU integration tests (3 files §6.3) | All green |
| **P8** | 1h | Production E2E (`create_role` MLE run) | Aggregator input contains "aggregating" |
| **P9** | 30min | Documentation: README in `file_space_manager/`, update `VERIFICATION.md` with new audit checks | Doc review passes |

**Total**: ~10.5 hours

**Stop-gate after each phase**: if validation fails, do not proceed.

