## §9 Risks & Mitigations

| # | Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| R1 | Refactor breaks subtle behavior in `_find_variable_file_with_slash` | Port behavior 1:1; cover with regression tests |
| R2 | YAML sidecar scoped storage interacts oddly with multi-root | Keep sidecar storage in `FileBasedVariableManager` (per §4.2); FileSpaceManager only does the file READ |
| R3 | Override-suffix priority differs across managers | Codify in `VersionCascade` once; remove duplicate logic |
| R4 | Constraint A breaks existing flat-version lookups when caller didn't realize they were setting master_version | Document loud + add lint check (warn if master_version is set without explicit intent in inferencer config) |
| R5 | Pass 3 back-compat masks migration bugs (file should have moved but didn't) | After P5, run a "stale flat-file scan" that warns on any `{folder}.{master}.{ext}` matching a known master_version |
| R6 | Cross-root sidecar overwrite=False semantics get lost | Pin down in `FileBasedVariableManager.get_all_variables` + add multi-root sidecar test |
| R7 | Performance regression from extra abstraction layer | Benchmark a 100-variable resolution before/after; target <5% slowdown |
| R8 | Production runs break before E2E lands | Roll out behind feature flag (e.g., `FILE_SPACE_MANAGER_ENABLED=true`) for first 24h |
| R9 | The "scope tax" — too many open files during a single render | Cache resolved paths per-render (memoize within `__call__`) |
| R10 | Documentation drift between manager docstrings and FileSpaceManager docstrings | Single canonical doc in `file_space_manager/README.md`; both managers' docstrings link to it |

---

## §10 Open Questions

| OQ | Question | Default Position |
|---|---|---|
| OQ1 | Should `template_version` and `template_master_version` co-exist, or should master replace version when both are wanted? | Co-exist. They have different semantics — version says "which variant", master says "which qualified family". |
| OQ2 | Should FileSpaceManager support multi-root WRITE (e.g., for `set` overrides)? | NO — write to root[0] only, by convention |
| OQ3 | Should the `master_version` cascade support multi-level masters? (e.g., `aggregation/role_creation/default.jinja2`) | NOT in v2.0. Defer to v2.1 if a real need emerges. |
| OQ4 | Should `FileSpaceManager` be Pythonic-multi-callable (`__call__`) instead of explicit `find_file`? | NO — explicit method names are clearer for refactor |
| OQ5 | Should we deprecate Pass 3 immediately or keep indefinitely? | KEEP for v2.0; revisit in v2.x once filesystem is fully migrated |
| OQ6 | Should TemplatedInferencerBase auto-derive `template_master_version` from a tag (e.g., `is_aggregator=True`)? | NO — explicit attrib is clearer; SLOT_DEFAULTS already provides the convention |

